; configs enables dynamic zoom for a scope. The list includes new scopes added through
; addons such as BaS, RWA, etc. Scopes with similar names (e.g. 1pn93 and 1pn93n2) are
; not listed individually.
; For each scoped weapon/scope/scope texture that is not covered by any of the
; existing keywords simply add a new keyword: keyword = index of click sound

